Z||000000||hugh||11-11-2000||08:21 PM||||In New Jersey when you want special tags for your car you get the form from a motor vehicle agency.Fill it out,picking your choices in the order you prefer 1st,2nd,3rd etc.You then send the form along with$50.00 and cross your fingers that you get your first choice.I GOT MINE!!!<BR>First,some of you know I have a 345hp crate engine in my 88 GT.The small block Chevy is called the mouse motor.Therefore<BR> My tag----------MYTMOUS<BR>I know it's been done before,but with all the new members,what do you have on your license plate?||||reg||1
